{
    "background_story": "Sweetstuff was a prized thoroughbred with a shiny black coat and a sparkling personality. After a particularly grueling racing season, she developed a nasty hoof infection that threatened to end her career. Her devoted owner, Emma, was determined to nurse Sweetstuff back to health. Emma spent hours each day sanitizing Sweetstuff's stall, making sure every surface was spotless and germ-free. She also worked with the veterinarian to create a customized treatment plan, which included regular sanitizing of Sweetstuff's hooves and legs. Thanks to Emma's tireless efforts, Sweetstuff made a full recovery and returned to the racing circuit, stronger and healthier than ever. From then on, Emma made sure to prioritize sanitizing and cleanliness in Sweetstuff's care, knowing that it was key to her beloved horse's well-being.",
